comment "Partition tables"

config PTABLE_GPT
    bool "GUID partition tables"
    default y
    help
      Expose the partitions of a GPT disk
      as block devices of their own

config PTABLE_MBR
    bool "MBR partition tables"
    default y
    help
      Expose the four primary partitions of an MBR disk
      as block devices of their own
